          "axe, Lighthouse and similar tools in CI find a missing `alt`, low contrast on some text, duplicate ids, some ARIA mistakes. They will not tell you whether the alt is meaningful, whether focus order is logical, whether a modal is operable, or whether the text is understandable. A '95 score' is not AA conformance. Put a scanner in CI as a net against regressions, but plan a keyboard and manual pass. Fix findings; do not turn rules off without a reason. Combine with eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y in development.",
          ["Автоматизація — сітка регресій, не сертифікат AA", "Змістовність і клавіатуру автомати не бачать", "Не вимикайте правила без причини"],
